   'Como no tienen estructura celular propia, los virus dependen de una célula hospedera para replicarse.'),
  ('2764744c-fdbb-4e14-8c9c-c2e0938c9cd5', 'en',
   'Antibiotics, medicines widely used to fight infections, are effective specifically against:',
